OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs community centre bid for
OL,4,A#14.6m pool fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for funding from a
OL,7,Fscrapped leisure centre to be invested
OL,8,Finto a derelict community facility.
OL,10,FThe Greenwood Centre, in Swain House,
OL,11,Fhas been empty for many years and has
OL,12,Fbecome a target for vandalism and
OL,13,Farson.
OL,15,FNow Bradford East MP Imran Hussain has
OL,16,Fcalled on the council, which owns the
OL,17,Fbuilding, to use funding from the
OL,18,Fcancelled Squire Lane leisure centre to
OL,19,Fredevelop the building.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
