OL,3,GNEWSAMP backs community centre bid for
OL,4,A#14.6m pool fund
OL,5,
OL,6,FHussain said the building had "become a
OL,7,Fpersistent source of concern for local
OL,8,Fresidents and the emergency services,
OL,9,Fwith repeated incidents of anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour and risks to public safety".
